<title>FRANCE: TF1 sees 1997 sales topping 10 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>TF1 sees 1997 sales topping 10 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Television Francaise 1 (TF1), France's biggest commercial television broadcaster, expects 1997 sales to exceed 10 billion francs compared with 9.685 billion in 1996, chairman Patrick Le Lay told an analysts' meeting on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The sales will be over 10 billion francs,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
